          "type": "terms_conditions",
          "settings": {
            "terms_conditions": "<p>Actual price will depend on pay as you go or subscription plan purchase, promotional offers and discount codes are available to input at checkout. Requires an online consultation with a clinician who will determine if treatment is appropriate.<\/p><p><br\/>*Wharton S, et al. Once-weekly semaglutide 7.2 mg in adults with obesity (STEP UP): a randomised, controlled, phase 3b trial. The Lancet Diabetes & Endocrinology. 2025;13(11):949–963. This trial was for Wegovy over 72 weeks. Average weight loss: up to 20.7% in STEP UP trials. <\/p><p>**Glucagon-like peptide (GLP-1) <\/p><p><\/p>"
          }
